{
    "info":  {
                 "_postman_id":  "7a2f8d1c-3b4e-4f5a-9c6d-2e8f0a1b3c4d",
                 "name":  "8 - Gym Person",
                 "description":  "Endpoints to manage gym persons (staff and members) including profiles, account linking, and salary payments.",
                 "schema":  "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
             },
    "item":  [
                 {
                     "name":  "Get Paged Gym Persons",
                     "event":  [
                                   {
                                       "listen":  "test",
                                       "script":  {
                                                      "exec":  [
                                                                   "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
                                                                   "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                                                                   "});",
                                                                   "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                                                                   "if (jsonData \u0026\u0026 jsonData.data \u0026\u0026 jsonData.data.items \u0026\u0026 jsonData.data.items.length \u003e 0) {",
                                                                   "    pm.environment.set(\"gymPersonId\", jsonData.data.items[0].id);",
                                                                   "    pm.environment.set(\"gymPersonInviteCode\", jsonData.data.items[0].inviteCode);",
                                                                   "}"
                                                               ],
                                                      "type":  "text/javascript"
                                                  }
                                   }
                               ],
                     "request":  {
                                     "description":  "### Endpoint Overview\n\nFetches a paginated list of gym persons (staff and members) with dynamic sorting and filtering.\n\n---\n\n### Available Domain Attributes \u0026 Filter Reference\n\n| Attribute Name | Data Type | Filter Support | Description / Allowed Values |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| `Id` | `int` | Exact | Unique Identifier |\n| `GymId` | `int` | Exact | Associated Gym ID |\n| `UserId` | `int` | Exact | Associated User Account ID (Nullable) |\n| `PersonType` | `Enum (int)` | Exact | `0` = Staff, `1` = Member, `2` = Both |\n| `Name` | `string` | Searchable | Full name of the person |\n| `PhoneNumber` | `string` | Searchable | Contact phone |\n| `Email` | `string` | Searchable | Contact email (Nullable) |\n| `Gender` | `string` | - | Gender (Nullable) |\n| `DateOfBirth` | `DateTime` | - | Date of birth (Nullable) |\n| `PhotoUrl` | `string` | - | Photo URL (Nullable) |\n| `InviteCode` | `Guid` | - | Invitation code for linking user accounts |\n| `CreatedOn` | `DateTime` | Between | ISO format creation date |\n| `CreatedById` | `int` | Exact | Creator ID |\n| `UpdatedAt` | `DateTime` | - | Last update timestamp |\n| `IsActive` | `bool` | Exact | Active status |\n\n---\n\n### Filter Usage Guide (For Request Body)\n\n- **Exact Filters (`exactFilters`):** Pass attribute name with array of string/enum values. Example: `\"exactFilters\": { \"PersonType\": [\"1\"] }`\n- **Between Filters (`betweenFilters`):** Pass attribute name with `min` and `max`. Example: `\"betweenFilters\": { \"CreatedOn\": { \"min\": \"2026-01-01\", \"max\": \"2026-12-31\" } }`\n\n---\n\n### Authorization\n\nRequires gym membership with role `Owner`, `Manager`, `Coach`, or `Receptionist`. SuperAdmin bypasses all gym checks.",
                                     "method":  "POST",
                                     "header":  [
                                                    {
                                                        "key":  "Content-Type",
                                                        "value":  "application/json"
                                                    }
                                                ],
                                     "body":  {
                                                  "mode":  "raw",
                                                  "raw":  "{\n  \"pageNumber\": 1,\n  \"pageSize\": 10,\n  \"orderBy\": \"Id\",\n  \"orderDirection\": \"asc\",\n  \"filters\": {\n    \"betweenFilters\": {},\n    \"exactFilters\": {}\n  }\n}"
                                              },
                                     "url":  {
                                                 "raw":  "{{baseUrl}}/api/GymPerson",
                                                 "host":  [
                                                              "{{baseUrl}}"
                                                          ],
                                                 "path":  [
                                                              "api",
                                                              "GymPerson"
                                                          ]
                                             }
                                 },
                     "response":  [

                                  ]
                 },
                 {
                     "name":  "Get Gym Person By Id",
                     "request":  {
                                     "description":  "Fetches a single gym person by ID.\n\nRequires gym membership (`GymAuthorize`, any role). SuperAdmin bypasses all gym checks.",
                                     "method":  "GET",
                                     "header":  [

                                                ],
                                     "url":  {
                                                 "raw":  "{{baseUrl}}/api/GymPerson/{{gymPersonId}}",
                                                 "host":  [
                                                              "{{baseUrl}}"
                                                          ],
                                                 "path":  [
                                                              "api",
                                                              "GymPerson",
                                                              "{{gymPersonId}}"
                                                          ]
                                             }
                                 },
                     "response":  [

                                  ]
                 },
                 {
                     "name":  "Create Gym Person",
                     "event":  [
                                   {
                                       "listen":  "test",
                                       "script":  {
                                                      "exec":  [
                                                                   "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
                                                                   "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                                                                   "});",
                                                                   "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                                                                   "if (jsonData \u0026\u0026 jsonData.data \u0026\u0026 jsonData.data.id) {",
                                                                   "    pm.environment.set(\"gymPersonId\", jsonData.data.id);",
                                                                   "    pm.environment.set(\"gymPersonInviteCode\", jsonData.data.inviteCode);",
                                                                   "}"
                                                               ],
                                                      "type":  "text/javascript"
                                                  }
                                   }
                               ],
                     "request":  {
                                     "description":  "Creates a new gym person record. On success, `gymPersonId` and `gymPersonInviteCode` are captured for chaining.\n\n### Request Fields\n\n| Field | Type | Required | Description |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| `userId` | `int?` | No | Link to an existing registered account |\n| `personType` | `Enum (int)` | Yes | `0` = Staff, `1` = Member, `2` = Both |\n| `name` | `string` | Yes | Full name |\n| `phoneNumber` | `string` | Yes | Contact phone |\n| `email` | `string?` | No | Contact email |\n| `gender` | `string?` | No | Gender |\n| `dateOfBirth` | `DateTime?` | No | Date of birth (ISO format) |\n| `photoUrl` | `string?` | No | Photo URL |\n| `staffProfile` | `object?` | No | Required when `personType` is Staff/Both. Fields: `gymRoleId`, `salary`, `salaryValidFrom`, `salaryValidUntil` |\n| `memberProfile` | `object?` | No | Required when `personType` is Member/Both. Fields: `medicalNotes`, `notes` |\n\n### GymRole Enum Values\n\n`0` = Owner, `1` = Manager, `2` = Coach, `3` = Receptionist, `4` = Cleaner, `5` = Other, `10` = Member\n\n### Authorization\n\nRequires gym membership with role `Owner`, `Manager`, `Coach`, or `Receptionist`. SuperAdmin bypasses all gym checks.",
                                     "method":  "POST",
                                     "header":  [
                                                    {
                                                        "key":  "Content-Type",
                                                        "value":  "application/json"
                                                    }
                                                ],
                                     "body":  {
                                                  "mode":  "raw",
                                                  "raw":  "{\n  \"userId\": null,\n  \"personType\": 1,\n  \"name\": \"John Doe\",\n  \"phoneNumber\": \"+1234567890\",\n  \"email\": \"johndoe@example.com\",\n  \"gender\": \"Male\",\n  \"dateOfBirth\": \"1990-01-01\",\n  \"photoUrl\": null,\n  \"staffProfile\": null,\n  \"memberProfile\": {\n    \"medicalNotes\": \"No known allergies\",\n    \"notes\": \"Prefers morning sessions\"\n  }\n}"
                                              },
                                     "url":  {
                                                 "raw":  "{{baseUrl}}/api/GymPerson/Create",
                                                 "host":  [
                                                              "{{baseUrl}}"
                                                          ],
                                                 "path":  [
                                                              "api",
                                                              "GymPerson",
                                                              "Create"
                                                          ]
                                             }
                                 },
                     "response":  [

                                  ]
                 },
                 {
                     "name":  "Update Gym Person",
                     "request":  {
                                     "description":  "Updates an existing gym person by ID. Supports transitioning between staff/member profiles (see `personType`).\n\n### Request Fields\n\nSame structure as Create. When `personType` is Staff or Both, `staffProfile` fields apply; when Member or Both, `memberProfile` fields apply.\n\n### Authorization\n\nRequires gym membership with role `Owner`, `Manager`, `Coach`, or `Receptionist`. SuperAdmin bypasses all gym checks.",
                                     "method":  "PUT",
                                     "header":  [
                                                    {
                                                        "key":  "Content-Type",
                                                        "value":  "application/json"
                                                    }
                                                ],
                                     "body":  {
                                                  "mode":  "raw",
                                                  "raw":  "{\n  \"userId\": null,\n  \"personType\": 0,\n  \"name\": \"John Doe Updated\",\n  \"phoneNumber\": \"+1234567890\",\n  \"email\": \"johndoe@example.com\",\n  \"gender\": \"Male\",\n  \"dateOfBirth\": \"1990-01-01\",\n  \"photoUrl\": null,\n  \"staffProfile\": {\n    \"gymRoleId\": 2,\n    \"salary\": 1500.00,\n    \"salaryValidFrom\": \"2026-01-01\",\n    \"salaryValidUntil\": \"2026-12-31\"\n  },\n  \"memberProfile\": null\n}"
                                              },
                                     "url":  {
                                                 "raw":  "{{baseUrl}}/api/GymPerson/{{gymPersonId}}",
                                                 "host":  [
                                                              "{{baseUrl}}"
                                                          ],
                                                 "path":  [
                                                              "api",
                                                              "GymPerson",
                                                              "{{gymPersonId}}"
                                                          ]
                                             }
                                 },
                     "response":  [

                                  ]
                 },
                 {
                     "name":  "Link Account To Gym",
                     "request":  {
                                     "description":  "Links the currently authenticated user account to a gym using an invite code.\n\n### Query Parameters\n\n| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| `gymId` | `int` | Yes | Target gym ID |\n| `inviteCode` | `Guid` | Yes | Invite code from the gym person record (`inviteCode`) |\n\n### Behavior\n\n- Requires `[Authorize]` (any authenticated user).\n- Returns the linked `GymPersonRDTO`.\n- Fails with `400` if the invite code is invalid or already used.",
                                     "method":  "POST",
                                     "header":  [

                                                ],
                                     "url":  {
                                                 "raw":  "{{baseUrl}}/api/GymPerson/LinkAccountToGym?gymId={{gymId}}\u0026inviteCode={{gymPersonInviteCode}}",
                                                 "host":  [
                                                              "{{baseUrl}}"
                                                          ],
                                                 "path":  [
                                                              "api",
                                                              "GymPerson",
                                                              "LinkAccountToGym"
                                                          ],
                                                 "query":  [
                                                               {
                                                                   "key":  "gymId",
                                                                   "value":  "{{gymId}}"
                                                               },
                                                               {
                                                                   "key":  "inviteCode",
                                                                   "value":  "{{gymPersonInviteCode}}"
                                                               }
                                                           ]
                                             }
                                 },
                     "response":  [

                                  ]
                 },
                 {
                     "name":  "Pay Salary",
                     "request":  {
                                     "description":  "Initiates a salary payment for a staff member (`PersonType` Staff or Both).\n\n### Query Parameters\n\n| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| `salaryValidFrom` | `DateTime?` | No | Start of the salary validity period (ISO format) |\n| `salaryValidUntil` | `DateTime?` | No | End of the salary validity period (ISO format) |\n\n### Behavior\n\n- Fails with `400` if the person is not Staff/Both or has no staff profile.\n- Fails if `salary` is null/zero or the salary validity window is not active.\n- Publishes a `SalaryPaidEvent` on success.\n\n### Authorization\n\nRequires gym role `Owner` or `Manager`. SuperAdmin bypasses all gym checks.\n\nReturns `Result<string>` with message \"Salary payment initiated successfully.\"",
                                     "method":  "POST",
                                     "header":  [

                                                ],
                                     "url":  {
                                                 "raw":  "{{baseUrl}}/api/GymPerson/{{gymPersonId}}/pay-salary?salaryValidFrom=2026-01-01\u0026salaryValidUntil=2026-12-31",
                                                 "host":  [
                                                              "{{baseUrl}}"
                                                          ],
                                                 "path":  [
                                                              "api",
                                                              "GymPerson",
                                                              "{{gymPersonId}}",
                                                              "pay-salary"
                                                          ],
                                                 "query":  [
                                                               {
                                                                   "key":  "salaryValidFrom",
                                                                   "value":  "2026-01-01"
                                                               },
                                                               {
                                                                   "key":  "salaryValidUntil",
                                                                   "value":  "2026-12-31"
                                                               }
                                                           ]
                                             }
                                 },
                     "response":  [

                                  ]
                 },
